• Overlap protection and bounded shutdown are inherited. WindowsServiceHostBase skips a tick while the previous one is running (line 372 (../../General/MUFGT24_BTMUM_64/MUFG_T24/Core/Estructura/WindowsServiceHostBase.cs#L372)) and bounds stop to 60 s wait plus 30 s cleanup. The host finalizes with a separate cleanupCt (ServiceHost.cs (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/SwfINMQ/ServiceHost.cs#L158)), the right pattern for work that must still run after cancellation.
• Cancellation reaches the database calls that support it. ActualizaEJecucion, ObtenerFechaSistemaAsync, and ObtenerParametrosSistemaAsync all receive ct (OperacionServicio.cs (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/AplicacionSwfINMQ/OperacionServicio.cs#L55-L65)).
