MQ-FR-1 - Tuesday uses Monday's operating-window parameters
• Category / severity: MustChange/rewrite - Major
• Evidence: OperacionServicio.cs (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/AplicacionSwfINMQ/OperacionServicio.cs#L107-L117); the unused Tuesday keys are requested at ConstantesServicio.cs (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/AplicacionSwfINMQ/Enums/ConstantesServicio.cs#L11) and declared at lines 48-49 (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/AplicacionSwfINMQ/Enums/ConstantesServicio.cs#L48-L49)
Code block (csharp)
case DayOfWeek.Tuesday:
    if (TimeSpan.TryParse(_configuracion.ParametrosSistema[ConstantesServicio.HORA_OP_SWF_LU_INI], out var Tuesday))
        horaInicio = Tuesday;
    ...
    if (TimeSpan.TryParse(_configuracion.ParametrosSistema[ConstantesServicio.HORA_OP_SWF_LU_FIN], out var TuesdayFin))
