The Tuesday branch is a copy of the Monday branch that was never updated: both boundaries read HORA_OP_SWF_LU_*. HORA_OP_SWF_MA_INI and HORA_OP_SWF_MA_FIN are loaded from the database on every tick (and required by the shared loader) but are referenced nowhere else in the solution (0 uses). Tuesday is a business day, so this branch is reachable in normal operation. Whenever the configured Tuesday window differs from Monday's, the service opens and closes on the wrong schedule (late intake or intake outside the agreed hours); when the windows happen to be equal the defect is invisible until someone edits MA.
Recommendation: read HORA_OP_SWF_MA_INI/HORA_OP_SWF_MA_FIN for Tuesday, and replace the seven copy-pasted cases with the table-driven mapping in MQ-FR-6 so that one test per weekday proves the mapping. Treat this as a Blocker if production MA and LU values differ.
Benefit: the configured Tuesday window is honored and the defect cannot recur silently.
MQ-FR-2 - Saturday closes using Wednesday's closing parameter
• Category / severity: MustChange/rewrite - Major
• Evidence: OperacionServicio.cs (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_MQ/AplicacionSwfINMQ/OperacionServicio.cs#L151-L161); shared weekend gate at RepositorioMaestro.cs (../../General/MUFGT24_BTMUM_64/MUFG_T24/Infraestructura/Repositorios/DBs/RepositorioMaestro.cs#L1245-L1262)
